silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_closure_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '06ClosureYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 06_closure, the ] \\& |[rolenode]| TypedNode [r, arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens.; also, In the Music graph engine entry section 06_closure, the ]\\\\ |[schemanode]| $(-,MusicEngine)$ [u, arrow witnesses the DomesticCat classification arrow as a typed source leg into D_Mittens — NOT an identity onto Mittens." .
